cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "TCA–Nexus Linker"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
abstract: >-
  Web application used by IPBES experts to link the 22 transformative-change
  actions of the IPBES Transformative Change Assessment (chapter 5) to the 71
  response options of the IPBES Nexus Assessment (chapter 5). The application is
  an elicitation instrument rather than an inference tool: it proposes no
  candidate matches and computes no textual similarity, so every recorded link is
  an explicit judgement made by a named expert. Judgements are attributed,
  qualified as primary or secondary, never merged, and exported in structured
  form for analysis.
