  - type: software
    title: "IPBES TCA-Nexus literature pipeline"
    abstract: >-
      Literature-corpus analysis for the same article: OpenAlex corpus over the
      IPBES TCA and Nexus Zotero groups, SPECTER2 embeddings and BERTopic topics,
